  {
   "id": "superscout-296238@2.0",
   "gameId": "superscout-296238",
   "displayName": "Update 2.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-14T12:14:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello everyone",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you for recognizing the demo of Superscout, according to the feedback from players in different countries, we have updated the demo for the second time, the updates are as follows:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1、UI adaptation for demo's multi-language version has been realized.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2、Fixed the problem that the loading interface would appear when the interface is switched.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Optimized the interaction of WeChat interface, players can choose to continue the game when there is no necessary content.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Fixed the wrong text in the story line.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Added multi-language text in the WeChat function, now players from English, Japanese and Korean can also understand the chat content between characters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game continues to be optimized, any problems are welcome to find us feedback, and also welcome to negotiate all kinds of cooperation, contact email: shanyuhai@shanhaixingchen.com.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mountain & Sea Studio",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
